{"v":4,"catch":"將可愛的羊增加到 1000 隻吧！\n一人培育羊的卡牌遊戲《Shephy》！","desc":"◆ 培育羊遊戲是什麼？\n把一隻羊培養到 1000 隻羊，就是本遊戲的目標。\n靈活運用手裡的特殊卡牌，在 3 回合之內把羊增加到 1000 隻吧。\n\n◆ 設有初學者也能遊玩的「Practice Mode」！\n在「Tutorial」或 Practice Mode 中可以學習 Shephy 的規則。\n\n◆ 挑戰極限！「Challenge Mode」\n收集 1000 隻以上的羊的模式！\n在 3 回合之內挑戰看看能收集到多少隻的羊！\n\n◆ 能體驗Shephy故事的「Post Love Mode」\n可以觀賞羊群的故事的「Post Love Mode」。\n不同的故事設有不同的規則，可以體驗 Shephy 的新感覺。","publisher":"ARC SYSTEM WORKS","release":"2018-08-09","genres":["桌上遊戲","益智","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5f2ae87e661b388c6b2ec9853ba1a4efd6327e3057ac78b0f3f833a552e94bfe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/21475134d08d6d36f67fd2023aee1492e4cafe8ed6e0a6b551eb6f671b5d3833.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/66db20e5e89e9ff708d5cde46e24687dabe8a821afb664b428a80fcd9dc3c3ff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/72875f2bb29e51f0590e73cbd50b505f74c94ec0cf72d1bc797567ff831b4072.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0074c7bb540df35b3519c52e0fe37a9ebce8c69962ce17fdaff3da380743ea6d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e15669896af9bb43d89e3e4ce220483041f691dae34c30fb2f340c1e369a534.jpg"],"titleId":"010040b003e5e000","dlc":[]}